# The identity hooks are shell scripts, which a CR breaks: keep them LF wherever the clone is.
.githooks/* text eol=lf
# The packaging's shell scripts, likewise.
*.sh text eol=lf
# The licence and the notices the executable carries: the same bytes in every build.
LICENSE text eol=lf
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt text eol=lf
# The end-user licence every package carries and shows: the same bytes on every platform.
LICENSE text eol=lf
# The Sudoku Exchange puzzles, as the puzzle bank publishes them: 100-byte records, LF line ends, on every platform.
puzzles/sudoku_exchange/*.txt -text
